        {
          "text": "Alimwi ambila bana ba-Israyeli kuti, Amubweze sijembwe, abe cipaizyo cazibi, akapoho akabelele, toonse tuli amwaka omwe, tutakwe kampenda, tube cipaizyo cakutenta, ",
